WEBVTT

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:07.190
We finally reached the finals of the district tournament!

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:12.320
Reika-chan!

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:17.670
Hey! I told you already to watch out for her! This is too much!

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:20.200
I'm sorry, it just happened...

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.370
Yoi!

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:27.250
But Reika-chan got hurt during the match because of me.

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:30.130
We had to play with ten players.

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:32.010
Ouzou-kun!

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:35.180
Not yet. You're not awake yet.

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:38.390
I was down in the dumps,

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:41.250
but the Furuyas got me out of it.

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:45.030
And just like what Coach Hanashima said,

00:00:45.030 --> 00:00:47.400
we used our own strong points.

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:53.030
And we finally won the district tournament!

00:02:29.390 --> 00:02:31.420
Cheers!

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:35.130
This is awesome!

00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:38.430
You just gulp it down like usual.

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:43.540
Yeah! The victory juice is the best!

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:47.180
Yep! It's really good.

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:53.120
Reika-chan, sorry about your leg.

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:54.960
I'm fine now.

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:56.110
Right, Mama?

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:57.270
Yes.

00:02:57.270 --> 00:03:01.220
Outa-kun, I might have went too far during the match.

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:02.830
I'm really sorry.

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:05.870
N-No, it's fine, really.

00:03:06.590 --> 00:03:10.530
Well, I also interrupted the last party.

00:03:10.530 --> 00:03:13.780
I need to properly make up for that.

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:32.690
This taste! It's so good!{So good! This taste!}

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:37.280
This is A5 grade beef - the best of the best.

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:39.520
Yes, the best.

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:40.950
Not bad.{This is pretty good.}

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:44.360
I brought catering from a five-star hotel.

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:46.950
Eat up, everyone.

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:49.830
So good! It's melting in my mouth!

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:53.040
Yep! The fish are so fresh!

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:56.000
Master! Ten pieces of fatty tuna!

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.380
Uematsu-kun, have some juice!

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:02.840
Here, Ukishima-kun and Uchimura-kun, too.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:05.010
You should eat up too, Shou-kun.

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:08.350
Well, I was a mess during the match.

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:12.500
It's thanks to all of you that we can go to the city tournament.

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:14.310
Let me do at least this much.

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:15.800
That's not true.

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:18.040
You did your best too, Shou-kun.

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:20.680
Yes, yes. Don't worry about us and take a break.

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:22.530
I'm fine...

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:26.280
He's right. Rest is important.

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:31.640
There's still two weeks until the city tournament.

00:04:31.640 --> 00:04:34.220
Perfect for resting your bodies.

00:04:34.220 --> 00:04:37.740
We'll take a break from practice for the next three days.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:41.050
Eh!?

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:48.500
Jeez, all I want to do is get even better at soccer!{Jeez, I wanted to get better at soccer!}

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:51.060
I'll be practicing on my own!

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:52.890
Well, you're right.

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:57.050
You need to practice 20 times harder during the break,

00:04:57.050 --> 00:05:00.210
just so you can catch up to us.

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:03.110
H-Hey, Erika-chan! That's too much!

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:04.740
Really?

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:11.790
Well, Coach <i>does</i> have a point.

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:16.490
If you tire out your body, you might get injured.

00:05:16.490 --> 00:05:18.750
You should rest up, Kota.

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:20.140
No.

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:23.060
Reika and I will be practicing together.

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:24.910
How about the 3U?

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:27.220
Um, we will...

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:30.970
You guys are swamped with middle school entrance exams and cram school, right?

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:34.600
Study hard during these three days, okay?

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:38.900
The U in 3U stands for "Yuutousei," right? (Honor student)

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:44.860
No! Yuutousei starts with a Y, not a U!

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:46.970
I know that.

00:05:46.970 --> 00:05:48.580
Can't take a joke?

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:49.820
There, there.

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:54.560
We have cram school tomorrow, so we'll be taking off now.

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:56.460
We won't take part in self-practice.

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:58.290
L-Later.

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:05.920
Will they really not practice?

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:20.540
Nice pass.

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:22.020
Here, too!

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:22.980
Okay!

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:41.670
Why are you practicing secretly?

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:43.530
Same goes for you, Uematsu.

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:46.530
It turned out to be such a big lie.{That was such a big lie.}

00:06:46.530 --> 00:06:50.230
Well, I guessed you two would come, too.

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:56.430
Our time to play soccer is running out.

00:06:58.640 --> 00:07:01.600
I've been thinking since last night.

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:04.860
During the city tournament, our
 opponents will be stronger than ever.

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:07.960
The triplets will get man-marked even more.

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:12.740
Then it'll be harder for the Furuyas to orchestrate any offense.

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:13.790
Yeah.

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:19.910
If the three of us take their place and start our own offense...

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:22.970
We can keep on winning even in the city tournament!

00:07:22.970 --> 00:07:26.930
So in these three days, we need to figure out a Big Tri like the triplets.

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:28.630
Let's think up our own special move!

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:31.340
Yes! That's a great idea!

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:34.170
Special training for a special move?

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:35.510
I'm getting pumped up!

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:38.810
Uchimura! Uki!

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:40.480
Okay! Let's do this!

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:50.820
So why are we at the local library?

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:54.280
We need to figure out what kind of play we'll do.

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:56.600
We're here to do research on that.

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:58.680
That's just like you, bookworm Uematsu.

00:07:58.680 --> 00:08:00.920
I'm not a bookworm!

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:04.710
What's up? What's the matter?

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:05.980
Ninja!

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:09.460
I've loved ninjas since I was little!

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:12.200
What do ninjas have to do with our special training?

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:14.930
Look! It's written here.

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:19.390
We are the 3U Ninjas!

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:22.350
Ninjas have these really long headbands.

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:26.690
They train really hard by running fast enough to not let the headbands touch the ground.

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:30.960
If we do this everyday, we can become speed demons!

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:33.100
No, we won't!

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:37.450
We only have three days! Three days!

00:08:38.020 --> 00:08:41.250
And we can't use those long headbands during matches!

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:43.160
Shh!

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:45.590
S-Sorry!

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:51.260
Anyway, we need something more down-to-earth.

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:52.920
Karate?

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:53.800
Yes.

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:56.300
People keep calling me a bookworm,

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:58.510
but I actually look up to strong guys.

00:08:58.510 --> 00:09:02.520
If you're strong, you can go up against anything!

00:09:11.460 --> 00:09:14.570
Ow! It hurts!

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:16.960
Breaking those are impossible.

00:09:16.960 --> 00:09:18.770
B-But...

00:09:18.770 --> 00:09:22.040
Soccer has nothing to do with your hands, anyway.

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:26.540
Jeez, we didn't find anything useful in the end.

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:28.740
We need to go back to the basics, then.

00:09:28.740 --> 00:09:31.000
Let's start with naming our own special move!

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:33.250
Special move name?

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:35.490
Yeah. For example...

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:37.760
When did you borrow that hero picture book?

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:41.720
3U Galaxy Aurora Slash!

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:46.250
That's cold, Uchimura.

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:48.700
Don't just put Ginga into everything.

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:52.710
Then how about this? It'll be cool!

00:09:52.710 --> 00:09:54.760
Uchimura Special!

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:57.350
You're just copying the Suguro Special!

00:09:57.350 --> 00:10:00.160
What happened to 3U?

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:01.250
Then how about...

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:02.030
Taro!

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:03.560
Oh, Mom!

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:05.160
How long are you going to fool around?

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:06.480
Get going to the cram school already!

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:09.000
Oh no! It's time already!

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:11.380
Yuuto, don't just stand there!

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:12.620
I'm sorry!

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:14.870
Kei! What are you doing?

00:10:14.870 --> 00:10:16.470
I know!

00:10:29.550 --> 00:10:31.890
What do we do about the special training tomorrow?

00:10:31.890 --> 00:10:33.290
Got any ideas?

00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:41.900
Uematsu seems to be free. How about you?

00:10:41.900 --> 00:10:44.630
Is there any move we can learn in an instant?

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:53.560
What? You guys are still playing soccer?

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:54.880
Yes.

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:59.080
Please finish up that business before summer classes.

00:10:59.080 --> 00:11:00.840
It'll affect your studies.

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:03.760
Yes.

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:10.060
We're closing now! Thank you very much!

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:14.860
There's no time left!

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:18.050
If we lose in the city tournament, that's it for us!

00:11:18.050 --> 00:11:19.820
Didn't we promise our parents?

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:23.780
After this tournament, we'll focus on our entrance exams and our cram school.

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:27.490
This is the last time we can play soccer together!

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:29.670
I know that.

00:11:29.670 --> 00:11:32.480
We're doing our best...

00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:35.630
Are you two even serious about this!?

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:38.090
I get it.

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:41.050
Why don't you think about it yourself, then?

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:44.760
Yeah! We'll do things our way.

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:07.280
I'm sorry. I overheard you guys.

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:09.370
It's fine, don't worry about it.

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:18.490
I didn't know you guys had such worries.

00:12:18.490 --> 00:12:22.050
So you can't play soccer anymore if we lose?

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:24.060
Yes.

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:29.010
I've always played soccer with the two of them.

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:32.470
When the Momoyama Predators disbanded,

00:12:32.470 --> 00:12:35.630
I thought it was all over. I gave up.

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:42.690
But you brought us together again and revived the team.

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:47.160
I was really happy that we could play soccer again.

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:53.710
I didn't really care about winning or losing, 
just that the three of us could play together again.

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:58.960
But when we won our first match, and our second match...

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:03.720
We kept on winning and I thought maybe we could do this.

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:08.350
We even won the finals and reached the city tournament.

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:13.760
As long as we keep winning, we can keep playing soccer together.

00:13:13.760 --> 00:13:18.530
So then I thought maybe we should keep on playing until we conquer the entire nation.

00:13:18.530 --> 00:13:20.820
We'll be split apart in middle school anyway.

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:22.670
Our days together are numbered.

00:13:22.670 --> 00:13:26.280
I want to keep on playing, if just for one more day.

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:29.740
In order to do that, we need to level up.

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:33.580
We decided to do some special training on our own...

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:37.460
but I don't think this will work.

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:39.830
That's not true!

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:41.950
Don't give up!

00:13:41.950 --> 00:13:45.670
We promised each other to set the galaxy as our goal!

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:50.140
I've always wanted to ask what you mean by that.

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:51.420
Eh?

00:13:51.420 --> 00:13:53.070
Oh, that's right.

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:56.140
You guys weren't here back then.

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:59.660
The entire nation? That's too small of a goal.

00:13:59.660 --> 00:14:02.110
If you are serious about this, aim even higher!

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:06.480
Then the goal is becoming number one in the world...

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:09.700
No, the number one team in the galaxy!

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:13.540
Oh? That's what you meant?

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:14.660
Yes!

00:14:15.300 --> 00:14:19.900
Hey, make up with the two of them tomorrow, please.

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:25.170
We'll all help you out so you guys can keep on playing soccer!

00:14:25.170 --> 00:14:27.130
But what about your practice?

00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:28.760
It's fine.

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:31.200
I owe you my thanks.

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:32.470
Thanks?

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:33.600
Yes.

00:14:34.250 --> 00:14:39.770
When I was looking for members, the three of you agreed immediately.

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:44.560
We can play soccer now thanks to the three of you!

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:50.070
I understand. Please help me out!

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:53.870
Next move, Zach!

00:14:55.900 --> 00:14:57.580
Nice, Zach!

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:21.310
Jeez, rest up.

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:42.620
Eh!? We can't use the park?

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:43.940
Yeah...

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:53.390
Oh man, we came all the way here to help you out.

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:53.390
Let's go!

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:58.370
Now the two of them won't come to practice.

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:54.790
Wait!

00:15:58.370 --> 00:16:02.400
Don't worry. I know of a place where we can still practice.

00:16:02.400 --> 00:16:05.900
Eh? There's such a place?

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:13.860
It's a narrow place between the apartment buildings,

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:21.120
but it's where I met Uki and Uchimura.

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:50.980
That place became our practice ground.

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:53.940
The place where we began playing soccer.

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:00.040
So they aren't here...

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:06.370
Eh? That's pretty good.

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:12.260
Hey, this is...

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:18.680
This is it! This shape! The triangle!

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:25.000
One person takes place of the wall and passes around to the other two players.

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:28.410
It's not as slick as the triplets' Big Tri,

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:31.690
but you can make beautiful one-two passes!

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:33.610
Wow!

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:38.570
That might work...

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:46.960
That sounds interesting.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:49.430
It might become our special move.

00:17:49.430 --> 00:17:51.590
Uki! Uchimura!

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:56.140
Well, this is the only place we can practice, right?

00:17:56.140 --> 00:17:59.180
I heard sounds off the wall while coming here.

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:01.590
Let us...

00:18:01.590 --> 00:18:03.590
...join in, then.

00:18:05.650 --> 00:18:08.190
Jeez, what are you two doing?

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:11.680
I'm sorry about yesterday!

00:18:11.680 --> 00:18:13.280
Let's start this again!

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:14.730
Okay!

00:18:14.730 --> 00:18:17.240
All right! You've made up!

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:22.800
What? Boys make up this easily?

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:26.660
That's their strong point!

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:30.670
Shou-kun, you thanked us yesterday.

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:33.480
But we need to thank you, too.

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:37.970
We love soccer.

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:42.380
We can play soccer again thanks to you.

00:18:42.380 --> 00:18:43.270
Everyone...

00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:47.180
Okay! We'll conquer the entire nation!

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:49.690
No! Number one in the galaxy!

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:52.190
Yeah!

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:56.530
Uematsu!

00:18:58.050 --> 00:18:59.950
Uki!

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:03.480
Uematsu!

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:05.640
Yes!

00:19:07.760 --> 00:19:09.300
Oh! Great!

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:10.020
This way!

00:19:10.020 --> 00:19:11.780
That's the way to go!

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:16.650
Taro, where did you go?

00:19:16.650 --> 00:19:18.970
H-Hey, what about cram school?

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:20.490
Don't worry about it.

00:19:20.490 --> 00:19:22.850
They won't find us here.

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:25.260
Let's just skip class today and tomorrow.

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:41.370
You want to have a 3v3 minigame with us?

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:42.720
Yep!

00:19:42.720 --> 00:19:47.070
We want to prove that we can contribute to the team.

00:19:47.070 --> 00:19:48.540
Can we?

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:53.160
What's with that getup?

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:58.470
This is the mark of our blood, sweat and tears for our special training these last two days.

00:19:58.470 --> 00:20:00.220
The atmosphere is important, right?

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:04.340
What's with this? I was the only one who rested up?

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:07.390
Sounds interesting. We accept.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:17.690
Okay.

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:24.050
Okay! Let's go!

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:25.570
Reverse Three!

00:20:31.930 --> 00:20:35.000
Triagular passes copying the Big Tri?

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:36.920
So that's the Reverse Three?

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:42.010
I can see the results of your special training.

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:43.970
But it's not enough.

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:46.420
You're basically passing through one man.

00:20:46.420 --> 00:20:49.000
We just have to mark the point man Uematsu.

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:53.890
3U's Yuutousei have a lot of work to do before they can beat us.

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:56.600
No! 3U's U...

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:03.900
...doesn't stand for Yuutousei!

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:15.580
It stands for Yuujou - our friendship that allows us to keep on playing soccer together!

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:19.290
Oh! Go!

00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:33.780
Crap!

00:21:33.780 --> 00:21:36.390
We just aren't...

00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:37.850
...good enough?

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:44.510
Hey, Yuujou does not start with a U...

00:21:46.730 --> 00:21:48.270
...but with a Y.

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:53.700
I know that!

00:21:54.640 --> 00:21:57.670
You're copying our Big Tri.

00:21:58.490 --> 00:22:00.630
That was...

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:13.350
Okay, well done, you three.

00:22:13.990 --> 00:22:17.830
The Furuyas will get man-marked to hell soon.

00:22:17.830 --> 00:22:21.280
That's when you three can show your skills!

00:22:21.280 --> 00:22:22.650
Really?

00:22:22.650 --> 00:22:23.800
Yes!

00:22:23.800 --> 00:22:26.490
You guys figured out your strong points.

00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:33.540
You have matured quite a bit during the last three days.

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:37.020
That's great, everyone!

00:22:37.020 --> 00:22:38.130
Yeah!

00:22:38.130 --> 00:22:41.560
Our special move will be the Reverse Three!

00:22:41.560 --> 00:22:44.970
Reverse Three sounds terrible.

00:22:44.970 --> 00:22:48.980
We're the Big Tri, so you three will be...

00:22:48.980 --> 00:22:50.760
Little Tri.

00:22:52.690 --> 00:22:53.860
Forget about that.

00:22:53.860 --> 00:22:58.000
I told you all to rest up, but you practiced on your own.

00:22:58.000 --> 00:22:59.930
Um, uh...

00:22:59.930 --> 00:23:01.910
Ow!

00:24:35.490 --> 00:24:37.090
I've been thinking about this.

00:24:37.090 --> 00:24:40.090
Shou-kun, why do you love soccer so much?

00:24:40.090 --> 00:24:42.980
Actually, I didn't really like it when I was little.

00:24:42.980 --> 00:24:44.380
Eh? That's hard to believe.

00:24:44.380 --> 00:24:46.540
My voice was weak and I didn't like sports.

00:24:46.540 --> 00:24:47.890
That's completely opposite from now!

00:24:47.890 --> 00:24:48.530
Yep.

00:24:48.530 --> 00:24:51.010
I changed when I met a certain someone.

00:24:51.010 --> 00:24:54.980
Next episode of Ginga e Kickoff!! Ball to the Future.
